---
description: Keep the application reliable for offline demonstrations.
globs: ["*.py", "*.json", "*.md"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Do not use external APIs.
- Do not require API keys.
- Do not introduce network dependencies.
- Ensure the local sample profile works.
- Provide useful error messages.
- Keep results deterministic.
- Ensure the application can run using local project data.